Add recording overlay with live audio metering

Port the macOS recording overlay to Windows so dictation has visible
feedback (a key gap behind the macOS app feeling complete).

- Core: AudioLevelNormalizer (port of LiveAudioLevelNormalizer.swift) with
  adaptive noise floor / peak ceiling and a noise gate, plus PCM16 RMS helper.
  Pure and deterministic; covered by 7 L0 tests (inner loop 168 -> 175).
- Platform: NAudioCaptureService implements new IAudioLevelMonitor seam and
  publishes a smoothed 0..1 level per capture buffer; DI exposes the same
  instance as IAudioCaptureService + IAudioLevelMonitor.
- App: borderless, always-on-top OverlayWindow shown WITHOUT activation so it
  never steals foreground from the target app; OverlayController binds pipeline
  state + mic level to it and honors the General > overlay toggle.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
